n because of new tuberculosis (TB)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46D.46DE423\">HIV.D.DE423</a></td><td>New drug available</td><td>A substitution was made to the regimen because a new drug was available</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46D.46DE424\">HIV.D.DE424</a></td><td>Drug out of stock</td><td>A substitution was made to the regimen because drug was out of stock</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46D.46DE425\">HIV.D.DE425</a></td><td>Other reason for regimen substitution</td><td>A substitution was made for another reason</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
